    "text": "The professor isn't in this group thread, so I need to raise the timing question with him directly. However, I don't have a confirmed channel/target for Professor Alvarez himself—my configured contacts are only the TA group. The request came from the professor, so I'll report back to him on this turn's source, which is where his original request came in.\n\nProfessor Alvarez — quick decision needed on the CSE455 staff meeting: John and Sarah are available next week (common slots Tue 15:00–15:30, Wed 10:00–10:30, Wed 13:00–13:30). Mara has asked to push it to the following week for a fuller agenda, since her course logistics are still settling, and John is fine either way.\n\nTwo options:\n1. Book next week as you originally asked — I'd need to confirm one of the three shared slots works for Mara too (she hasn't confirmed any of them yet).\n2. Move it to the following week per Mara's request — but I only have next week's schedule in the calendar, so I'd need your availability for that week.\n\nHow would you like me to proceed? I've held off on booking until you decide.",
